WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.134
Last Sunday Tim and his parents drove to Lake Chiemsee. The weather in the morning was fantastic: the sun was shining and it was almost thirty degrees.

00:00:11.384 --> 00:00:26.533
First they hired a boat and went to a small island. There they visited an old palace. After that they had a picnic on the shore. Tim's mother had brought bread, cheese and fruit.

00:00:26.783 --> 00:00:40.194
In the afternoon Tim swam in the lake. The water was cold but very clear. Suddenly the sky went dark and it started to thunder. Everyone got out of the water quickly.

00:00:40.444 --> 00:00:51.651
The family ran to the car, but they still got completely wet. On the way home Tim laughed: 'That was the best day of the holidays!'
